  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-06-08T18:59:35.853Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, if users want to use multiple OSC app at once they need to use a routing app, since VRChat provides only one listening port and one sending port.\n\nCan you make it so users can use multiple ports for listening and sending, so we do not have to use 3rd party apps ?",
